cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tamyiz, its items or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "tamyiz: reference readings by a panel of lawyers, and a test of whether AI contract reviewers settle what a playbook leaves open"
abstract: "A research programme on how AI systems read legal rules. Edge items place each position of a contract playbook at its limit; a panel of lawyers reads them blind and its disagreements are kept; AI reviewers from several providers read the same items; a team's rulings are tested on held-out wordings and guard items. This version contains the pilot (November 2026), its re-analysis with confidence intervals, and the protocol of Study A."
authors:
